# Normalise every text file to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
# Without this a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites the sources to
# CRLF, which shows up as whole-file diffs for contributors on other platforms
# and would also leak CRLF into the published npm tarball.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
